 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Co6aVv2nGA0Q7kNvwFDx2ju&_nc_oc=Ado0NfGG5V3DoqESlxWxk2rIIBPfuWajI_GL__FudmBw0y7p_FHFWvhEacMpCKP3nvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtMyJN6nxye8r95YJnCbQWEplCga5cF31vnoWZqTZf1w&oe=6AE75841"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Ewcb6haV2cQ7kNvwFOCXmD&_nc_oc=AdpfpoTJQEl0lH5XkjVoj3Gg1b5Ric-VRmmhwAyYSNmmuAammzEbC3EvRM5fCjI4xCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDyAVOyVl8iGLWtl48f7CMvYMuhMVYxWFxt8t1wCxyCw&oe=6AE765A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DNjFAMOXTVkQ7kNvwGVwmJM&_nc_oc=AdrzcAwTaKC4qcQQ_rxqdUfZ_Ci5feo0oi6WXlKiv62cxJq1n0T9ITOXzNGZK3mS8IA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlRMGprgOFAbFW4A6Wr_h3-mB3apxrZvcIizDKlhHKgw&oe=6AE76F9C"}, {"fil